WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.373
Step 1. Open the questionnaire.

1.2
00:00:02.373 --> 00:00:06.070
Each action runs after staff submit the questionnaire.

1.3
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:11.138
In the facility sidebar, select Settings, then Questionnaires under Forms,

1.4
00:00:11.138 --> 00:00:13.627
and select the questionnaire.

2.1
00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:18.138
Step 2. Open the question editor. Select Edit Questions.

2.2
00:00:18.138 --> 00:00:23.844
Care shows this button only if you hold Can Create/Update Questionnaires in

2.3
00:00:23.844 --> 00:00:25.509
Administration.

3.1
00:00:25.509 --> 00:00:28.168
Step 3. Open the Actions panel.

3.2
00:00:28.168 --> 00:00:33.144
In the outline on the left, below Form Settings, select Actions.

3.3
00:00:33.144 --> 00:00:37.455
The panel says: Run after this form is submitted.

4.1
00:00:37.455 --> 00:00:43.644
Step 4. Add an action. Select Add action. Care adds a card named Action 1,

4.2
00:00:43.644 --> 00:00:48.900
with When for the conditions and Then for the instructions.

5.1
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:53.557
Step 5. Choose when the action runs. Select Add a condition.

5.2
00:00:53.557 --> 00:00:59.506
Care fills the row with the first answer you can use; change the Operator and the

5.3
00:00:59.506 --> 00:01:01.210
Value as needed.

6.1
00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:04.059
Step 6. Choose what the action does.

6.2
00:01:04.059 --> 00:01:08.462
Under Then, select Add instruction and choose an Instruction.

6.3
00:01:08.462 --> 00:01:28.795
Insert an answer or patient detail puts each submission's answer into the message.

7.1
00:01:28.795 --> 00:01:31.013
Step 8. Check the actions.

7.2
00:01:31.013 --> 00:01:35.553
At the top of the question editor, Care shows Ready to save,

7.3
00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:39.484
or a button with the number of issues to fix.

8.1
00:01:39.484 --> 00:01:43.049
Step 9. Save the changes. Select Save Changes.

8.2
00:01:43.049 --> 00:01:46.363
Care shows Questionnaire updated successfully,

8.3
00:01:46.363 --> 00:01:50.989
and runs the actions when staff submit the questionnaire.
